title: "Metamaterial Workbench"
abstract: "Browser-based finite-element workbench for locally resonant metamaterials: Bloch band structures, band gaps, complex bands, sensitivity, edge waves (strip, finite and driven samples) and Zak-phase topology checks, for beam, shell and plate unit cells."
